    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maze Bounders</strong> is a rogue-like deck-builder that empowers you to carve out your own path through the twists and turns of the Maze.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577780/extras/b8a5bc2419e8b196da85c7fa3fe7f437.avif?t=1743677227\" width=620 height=220 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every Great Maze Needs a Great Adventurer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since time immemorial, the ever-changing walls of the Maze have attracted those brave enough to risk life and limb for glory\u2014and a bit of  gold. Now it's your turn, so grab your sword and venture out of your sleepy town into the unknown.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Limitless Options, Limitless Playthroughs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover dozens of pieces of equipment and 100s of cards unique to each character as you as you battle your way through the Maze's stages. Back in town, unlock powerful objects, cards and characters before venturing out again.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Variability Built Into Every Step\u00a0\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Maze  shifts each time you enter: enemies, elites and bosses change, new events emerge and rare challengers  appear. You'll never land between the same two walls twice.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maze Bounders</strong> is a rogue-like deck-builder that empowers you to carve out your own path through the twists and turns of the Maze.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577780/extras/b8a5bc2419e8b196da85c7fa3fe7f437.avif?t=1743677227\" width=620 height=220 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every Great Maze Needs a Great Adventurer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since time immemorial, the ever-changing walls of the Maze have attracted those brave enough to risk life and limb for glory\u2014and a bit of  gold. Now it's your turn, so grab your sword and venture out of your sleepy town into the unknown.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Limitless Options, Limitless Playthroughs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover dozens of pieces of equipment and 100s of cards unique to each character as you as you battle your way through the Maze's stages. Back in town, unlock powerful objects, cards and characters before venturing out again.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Variability Built Into Every Step\u00a0\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Maze  shifts each time you enter: enemies, elites and bosses change, new events emerge and rare challengers  appear. You'll never land between the same two walls twice.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Uncover the secrets at the heart of the Maze as you assemble a powerful arsenal of cards and mystical objects in this deck-building rogue-like adventure.\u00a0",
